WEBVTT

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:31.467
More on that after the break.

00:16:31.886 --> 00:16:38.886
(Music)

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:41.416
OK, this is going to be
a different kind of ad.

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:44.871
I've played a personal role in selecting
the sponsors for this podcast,

00:16:44.895 --> 00:16:47.601
because they all have
interesting cultures of their own.

00:16:47.625 --> 00:16:50.215
Today, we're going
inside the workplace at SAP.

00:16:50.239 --> 00:16:57.239
(Music)

00:16:59.969 --> 00:17:01.897
(Music fades out)